  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p>We are doing excursions and tours different: small groups, no crowds, docusing on living like a local and putting money back into local people's pockets throug our new scheme Tips for Locals!</p><p>We offer tours and shore excursions for both land tourists and cruise ship passengers. Alicante, Madrid, Barcelona, Valencia, London, Porto, Ibiza etc.</p><p>How are we different? </p><p>All guests live life like a local for a few hours. We visit secret locations away from the crowds including a local breakfast cafe for local food and drink, secret locations, and then finish with a local lunch, depending on the tour destination.</p><p>You can tell your customers that we offer small groups of nor more than 12 people for a more personal experience.</p><p>We cover the Med and the Caribbean and offer excellent london local excursions around Notting Hill, Camden and the East End.</p><p>Finally, we pay an industry-beating 40% commission! Unheard of.</p><p>Lastly, we have great references.</p><p>https://www.shoreexcursionsgroup.com/tour/experiencing-valencia-like-a-local/euvalocalvalencia</p></div>",
